    release: reconcile v0.2.0 prep — tripwire pin + changelog count
    
    The release-pin tripwire test (readme_acceptance_criteria_release_test.go)
    asserts README's `Current release: **vX**` deliberately, so it moves with each
    cut: bump its pinned value to v0.2.0 and update the failure message. The
    DF-BOARDCTL-50 historical contract strings about the v0.1.11 asset are true and
    stay. CHANGELOG commit count re-derived live (142 at the prior prep commit,
    143 including this one = v0.1.11..v0.2.0 at the tag).
    
    Unblocks the red prep CI (runs 41125609554 / 41125610600 failed only on the
    stale pin). Addresses RELEASE-2026-10-29-01.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
